@@ -4238,3 +4238,15 @@ The emitted lights and the standalone library shaders keep their physical illumi
   and solar corona. `numos_visible_discs.slangh`, the composite bindings and the PSR miss in
   `algorithm/geometry_resolver.slangh` compose them behind air, lunar coverage and clouds.
   `test_enhanced_sky.cpp` checks calibration, twilight, totality, star-air flags and block layout.
+
+## Enhanced night brightness and solar illumination after the first PoC test
+
+- `rtx_fork_numos_eclipse.*` resolves this frame's discs from the configured clock and the pinned
+  celestial functions. It integrates the union of lunar silhouettes against the visible Sun's
+  limb law. `rtx_numos.cpp` supplies the attenuated Sun to NUMOS before its bakes, clears stale
+  history on abrupt changes and keeps the authored value in Sky Tuning.
+- `rtx_fork_numos_night.*` passes the full solar colour and eclipse star controls to the camera
+  and PSR. The obsolete geometric-only host helper was removed from `rtx_atmosphere.*`.
+  `numos_night.h`, `numos_night.slangh` and `numos_visible_discs.slangh` apply the measured
+  image gain to the artwork and meteors and reveal the catalogue during a daytime eclipse.
+  The enhanced-sky unit covers partial, annular and total eclipses, overlapping moons and the clock.
